From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikolajs Agafonovs <nikolajs.agafonovs@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:45:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] JavaScript: web APIs for Web Components polyfills;
 NETSURF_JS_PROBE

webapi.js: TreeWalker, NodeIterator and NodeFilter; the bindings' own
tree accessors and methods taken before page scripts run, so that
selectors, traversal and serializing walk the real tree when a polyfill
(ShadyDOM) replaces firstChild, appendChild and the like; EventTarget's
prototype is the one nodes and the Window inherit; WebIDL constants on
the interface objects and constructor links; template.content,
importNode, adoptNode, CDATASection, HTMLDocument; MessageChannel;
the URL members of <a> and <area>; script src/async/nonce, Event
timeStamp, placeholder, element onerror; clearTimeout of any value;
document.currentScript from Window.bnd's currentScript().
NETSURF_JS_PROBE names a script run in every page after the web APIs
(tests/netsurf/run.sh --probe), to look into real sites.
---
